  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Quinto Censo de Poblacin y Vivienda</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Strengthening of the Haitian Statistical and Informatics Institute (IHSI) and Support for the Fifth Population and Housing Census.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general consiste en aumentar la produccin de datos socioeconmicos y demogrficos y su uso entre el pblico general, lasinstituciones privadas, la sociedad civil y las organizaciones internacionales. El objetivo especfico es contar con datossocioeconmicos y demogrficos de buena calidad en lo que respecta a su confiabilidad y oportunidad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to increase the production of socioeconomic anddemographic data and its use by public, private institutions, civil society, as well as international organizations.The specific objective is to provide quality socioeconomic and demographic data in terms of reliability andtimeliness.</narrative>
  </description>
